Scope: this license covers the add-on author's own files in fidelity/ that are not derived
from the Source SDK: the PowerShell and batch scripts, the C# helpers, game/cfg and tools/.
The HLSL shaders in shaders/src (fidelity_water_* and fidelity_water_helper.h come from
Mapbase's SDK_Water shaders), the shaders compiled from them in game/shaders/fxc, and the C++
in sp/ are written for Valve's Source SDK 2013 and fall under the Source 1 SDK License
(https://github.com/ValveSoftware/source-sdk-2013/blob/master/LICENSE): Source engine only.
FXAA (shaders/src/fidelity_fxaa_ps2x.fxc) is re-implemented after Timothy Lottes' FXAA 3.11.

